{"type": "text", "text": "I have all the information needed. Here is my report.

## File locations

All paths are absolute under `/workspace/repo`.

1. **ModelingSubmissionService**
   `/workspace/repo/src/main/webapp/app/exercises/modeling/participate/modeling-submission.service.ts`

2. **ModelingFeedbackSuggestion class**
   `/workspace/repo/src/main/webapp/app/entities/feedback-suggestion.model.ts` (defined at lines 30-53; the file also defines `TextFeedbackSuggestion` and `ProgrammingFeedbackSuggestion`)

3. **ModelingSubmissionComponent**
   `/workspace/repo/src/main/webapp/app/exercises/modeling/participate/modeling-submission.component.ts` (calls `getLatestSubmissionForModelingEditor` at line 139)

4. **`getLatestSubmissionForModelingEditor`**
   Defined in the service file above at lines 130-134. Only caller is the component (line 139).

5. **Athena feedback-suggestion processing (elementIds / reference splitting)**
   `/workspace/repo/src/main/webapp/app/assessment/athena.service.ts` — `getModelingFeedbackSuggestions()` (lines 169-215) converts `ModelingFeedbackSuggestion` objects into `Feedback` objects. This is where `suggestion.elementIds` is filtered to pick the first unreferenced element (line 186) and where `feedback.reference` is built as `` `${element?.type}:${referenceId}` `` (line 199). There is a sibling method just above it (ending ~line 160) that does the equivalent for text/programming suggestions.

6. **Related service (ModelingExerciseService)**
   `/workspace/repo/src/main/webapp/app/exercises/modeling/manage/modeling-exercise.service.ts`
   Note: I searched the whole webapp and found **no** frontend reference to a `submissions-with-results` endpoint (in this service or anywhere). This service handles CRUD/import of modeling exercises, not submissions-with-results.

---

